#: src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:483
msgid ""
"Share this code with your trusted contact. They should add it to an "
"authenticator app such as Gnome Authenticator.\n"
"\n"
"If entering manually, ensure the following settings:\n"
"• Algorithm: SHA1\n"
"• Digits: 6\n"
"• Interval: 60 seconds\n"
"\n"
"Each action has its own code. When triggering an action by SMS, they must "
"append the current 6-digit code from their authenticator after the keyword."
msgstr ""
"Delite to kodo s svojim zaupanja vrednim stikom. Dodati jo morajo v "
"aplikacijo za preverjanje pristnosti, kot je Gnome Authenticator.\n"
"\n"
"Pri ročnem vnosu preverite naslednje nastavitve:\n"
"• Algoritem: SHA1\n"
"• Števke: 6\n"
"• Interval: 60 sekund\n"
"\n"
"Vsako dejanje ima svojo kodo. Pri sprožitvi dejanja s SMS morajo "
"po ključni besedi dodati trenutno 6-mestno kodo iz svojega avtentikatorja."

